# c04-paused-reload-twice: section 7 C04 (H4) - the C02 trace survives two paused reloads
exit ok
frame 250/250/0
frame 500/250/0
frame 750/250/0
count tickAttempts 6
count suppressedTicks 3
count emittedTickFrames 3
count publicUpdateAttempts 3
count publicUpdateSuccesses 3
count frameCount 3
require-count host.reload-sample 2
require-count normalizedSimulationDeltaTimeMs=0 2
require-count targetSimulationDeltaTimeMs=250 1
require-count targetSimulationDeltaTimeMs=0 1
# NOTE (kept for verification): section 5 and H4 item 1 make the first reload pass the frame the
# last tick actually submitted (dt=250) and the second reload pass the frame the first reload
# stored (dt=0), while both normalized samples are 0. The task table asked for
# "require-count targetSimulationDeltaTimeMs=0 2", which holds only if the host normalizes the
# argument before the call, and the mutation argument in section 5 (a mutant that drops the
# lastSampleFrame zeroing must be caught) excludes that. Confirm against the implemented action.
